OL,3,ANvidia-backed AI data centre firm
OL,4,Ascraps mega listing due to market
OL,5,Avolatility
OL,6,
OL,7,FArtificial intelligence (AI) data
OL,8,Fcentre company Firmus has scrapped its
OL,9,Fplans for what would have been one of
OL,10,FAustralia's biggest-ever stock market
OL,11,Flistings.
OL,13,FThe Nvidia-backed firm said it had made
OL,14,Fthe decision due to "recent market
OL,15,Fvolatility and prevailing market
OL,16,Fconditions" and that going public would
OL,17,Fnot be in the company or shareholders'
OL,18,Fbest interests.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
